type: dataset
title: "AI Visibility Index: which agencies do ChatGPT, Perplexity and Gemini recommend?"
abstract: >-
  Open measurement of how ChatGPT, Perplexity and Gemini answer buying questions
  about agencies for AI search visibility (GEO) in German and English. Baseline of
  525 measurements (September 2026) and bi-weekly pulse measurements, with named
  providers and cited sources.
